  "notes": "Modal is used to show a dialog or a box when you click a button.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/modal/+page.md",
  "code": "<!-- The button's popovertarget attribute points to the modal's ID. ID must be unique for each modal -->\n<button class=\"btn\" popovertarget=\"my-modal-1\">Open</button>\n\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"my-modal-1\" popover>\n  <div class=\"modal-box\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Hello!</h3>\n    <p class=\"py-4\">Press ESC key or click the button below to close</p>\n    <div class=\"modal-action\">\n      <button popovertarget=\"my-modal-1\" popovertargetaction=\"hide\">close</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
